。進之曰：「非吾志也。」竟不行。武帝嘉之。梁台建，曆尚書左丞，廣平、天門二郡太守，左衞將軍，封建甯公。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangjinzhi:p001:m0003","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangjinzhi:p001:m0000","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangjinzhi:p001","surface":"輿之子進之","start":0,"end":5}}],"status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"傳首具名父子。","human_reviewed":false}},{"id":"72e_1a7_3ac_AAA","label":"王清（王進之子，中廬公）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"清","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0003","c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0072","c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0104","c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0114"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-024","source_id":"s-nanshi-024-wangqing-ws1765279","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001","quote":"清","mention_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0003"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-024","source_id":"s-nanshi-024-wangqing-ws1765279","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001","quote":"清","mention_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0072"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-024","source_id":"s-nanshi-024-wangqing-ws1765279","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001","quote":"清","mention_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0104"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-024","source_id":"s-nanshi-024-wangqing-ws1765279","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001","quote":"清","mention_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0114"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"南24具名父進之，遇害，子猛。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"72e_1a7_3ac_AA","source_assertion_id":"a-nanshi024-wangqing-qing-father","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-024","source_id":"s-nanshi-024-wangqing-ws1765279","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001","quote":"進之子清，位散騎常侍，金紫光祿大夫，鎭東府長史，新野、東陽二郡太守，安南將軍，封中廬公。承聖末，陳武帝殺太尉王僧辯，遣文帝攻僧辯婿杜龕，龕告難於清，引兵援龕，大敗陳文帝于呉興，追奔至晉陵。時廣州刺史歐陽頠亦同清援龕，中更改異，殺清而歸陳武帝。子猛。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0003","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0000","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001","surface":"進之子清","start":0,"end":4}}],"status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"原傳首明記。","human_reviewed":false}},{"id":"72e_1a7_3ac_AAAA","label":"王猛（字世雄，本名勇）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"猛","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0122"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-024","source_id":"s-nanshi-024-wangqing-ws1765279","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001","quote":"猛","mention_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0122"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"王清子，仕陳隋。異於前秦字景略的王猛。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"72e_1a7_3ac_AAA","source_assertion_id":"a-nanshi024-wangqing-meng-father","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-024","source_id":"s-nanshi-024-wangqing-ws1765279","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001","quote":"進之子清，位散騎常侍，金紫光祿大夫，鎭東府長史，新野、東陽二郡太守，安南將軍，封中廬公。承聖末，陳武帝殺太尉王僧辯，遣文帝攻僧辯婿杜龕，龕告難於清，引兵援龕，大敗陳文帝于呉興，追奔至晉陵。時廣州刺史歐陽頠亦同清援龕，中更改異，殺清而歸陳武帝。子猛。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0122","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0114","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001","surface":"子猛","start":121,"end":123}}],"status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"傳尾子猛承王清，後王猛本題於173行重記父清。","human_reviewed":false}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-nanshi-024-wangqing-ws1765279","work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-024","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangqing","raw_mention_count":4,"mention_ids":["c-nanshi-024-wangqing: